      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vinton%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Vinton borders 1.5 miles of lakefront in the Roanoke River Gorge, a lake formed by the 1904 Niagara dam that is rarely seen.",
